WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.360
Long after Adam, people slowly forgot Allah's teachings, and their lives became lost and confused.

2
00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:11.248
Allah chose Idris and made him a prophet. A holy light came down upon him.

3
00:00:11.648 --> 00:00:18.200
Idris told the people, Worship only the One Allah. Be honest, be kind, and help one another.

4
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:24.120
He was the first to pick up a pen. He taught people about the stars, numbers, and counting.

5
00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:29.032
Some people listened to him and changed their ways. But others just turned and walked away.

6
00:00:29.432 --> 00:00:33.584
Allah raised Idris to a high station. That is what the Quran tells us.

7
00:00:33.984 --> 00:00:40.632
Idris teaches us to love knowledge, and to be honest and upright. Learning is also a way of worshipping Allah.
